Content:
@38:00 You are showing a bunch of clips from RT ("Russia Today").

That's... not a good source.  It's a propaganda arm of the Russian government.  In the era you are clipping from, RT was in its credibility building phase, and if I remember right was reasonably good.  But then they began pushing the Russian government spin pretty hard.

At minimum, you need other sources as well.  The release of the Monsanto Papers was pretty widely covered.

@veritasium In our current day you can look at Tata Steel doing similar practises with "steel slugs". They are highly dangerous for your health and environment, but they constantly try to rebrand it as a "construction material" so it can be used for roads and such; which in turn kills or hurts anything near it (like polluting the water supply and soil). If they aren't able to classify it as construction material; they would have to despose of it as "garbage" and nobody wants that stuff because of the health and environmental risks it causes.

One municipality called "Eerbeek" in the Netherlands has steel slugs where it was used as a foundation for a solar farm. Which polluted the water and caused health problems all over the place.

They also manipulated research and even convinced whoever was in charge of classification of materials to not make it "garbage", but allow it as "construction material" despite the effects already being known for years. So many municipalities were suckered into it as a "cheap building material" and now they are stuck with waste they can't get rid of and they can't hold the company liable either, because it was legalised because of the classification...

@41:34 this is a really creepy statement that can be associated with the Covid vaccines.

Why did they force everyone to get the jab.  Why did they go so far to censor anyone asking questions.  Look at the great Barrington declaration.  Why was Fauci given a preemptive pardon when he's already at the tail end of his life.  Why are the vaccine companies immune from lawsuits.  Why could we buy stocks into these companies.

I wasn't against the vaccine 100% but to force everyone and censor others was a definite red flag.
